{# Formal Arabic meeting report (Section 10.1).

   The layout is shared because the context already carries every string
   formatted in Arabic and `direction` is already "rtl"; only the font stack
   genuinely differs. Override any block here to diverge from the shared
   layout without touching the English report.
#}
{% extends "_shared/meeting_report.html.j2" %}
{# Tahoma first: it has proper Arabic coverage and is present on Windows and
   Office/Outlook. Without it a Latin-first stack falls back unpredictably and
   Arabic renders with broken joining. #}
{% block font_stack %}Tahoma,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif{% endblock %}
